# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# Values from solids4foam ed7f957f, whose electroMechanicalLaw pushes the active
# stress forward with the deformation gradient (#393).
# Probe values at t = 0.02 s. Column indices count the whitespace-separated
# fields of the probe file after stripping the parentheses that vector probes
# write, so time is column 1, probe 0 is columns 2..4 for a vector and column 2
# for a scalar.
#
probe  postProcessing/CaiProbes/electro/0/activationTime  0.02  2  0.00323067    1e-5
probe  postProcessing/CaiProbes/electro/0/activationTime  0.02  3  -1            1e-9
probe  postProcessing/Taprobes/solid/0/D                  0.02  2  3.74716e-05   1e-6
probe  postProcessing/Taprobes/solid/0/D                  0.02  4  -5.08826e-05  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/Taprobes/solid/0/D                  0.02  6  -0.000194546  2e-6
probe  postProcessing/Taprobes/solid/0/Ta                 0.02  2  5730.09       60.0
